Package: GOLDBioAge
Type: Package
Title: Biological Age Estimation Based on Gompertz Law
Version: 0.2.1
Author: Meng Hao
Maintainer: Meng Hao <haombio@gmail.com>
Description: Fits Gompertz law-based biological age (GOLD BioAge) and Cox-based
    biological age models using survival follow-up and biomarkers. Supports
    optional penalized Cox feature selection and scoring new observations with
    frozen GOLD or Cox biological age coefficients. Includes NHANES example data
    and reproducible tutorials comparing the two approaches.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports: 
    flexsurv,
    stats,
    survival,
    utils
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.6.0)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests: 
    glmnet,
    ggplot2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
URL: https://github.com/Jerryhaom/GOLDBioAge
BugReports: https://github.com/Jerryhaom/GOLDBioAge/issues
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
